  "description": {
    "text": "The third yearly Pokémon TCG Holiday Calendar, out in August 2024: 25 days of surprises, eight of them foil cards with a snowflake stamp. They reprint Scarlet & Violet cards, keeping their set codes and numbers: Chien-Pao ex, Pikachu ex and Eiscue ex, and five more in cosmos holo.\n\nThe calendar also held five booster packs, seven three-card fun packs, two coins, two sticker sheets, a Chien-Pao sidekick dangler and a code card for Pokémon TCG Live.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "ICv2: 'Pokemon TCG: Holiday Calendar 2024' Unveiled (7 June 2024)",
        "url": "https://icv2.com/articles/news/view/57076/pokemon-tcg-holiday-calendar-2024-unveiled"
      },
      {
        "title": "Card Gamer: Pokemon TCG Holiday Calendar 2024 Card List",
        "url": "https://cardgamer.com/games/tcgs/pokemon/pokemon-holiday-calendar-2024-card-list/"
      },
